t\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/AnnotationViewExample"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Implement this method to mark a point annotation with a view object. If you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"want to mark a particular point annotation with a static image instead, omit"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this method or have it return "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" for that annotation, then implement"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-mapView:imageForAnnotation:"},{"type":"text","text":" instead."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Annotation views are compatible with UIKit, Core Animation, and other Cocoa"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Touch frameworks. On the other hand, static annotation images use less memory","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and draw more quickly than annotation views.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The user location annotation view can also be customized via this method. When"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"annotation"},{"type":"text","text":" is an instance of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNUserLocation","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" (or equal to the map view’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"userLocation"},{"type":"text","text":" property), return an instance of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNUserLocationAnnotationView","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(or a subclass thereof)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Related examples","anchor":"Related-examples","type":"heading","level":4},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text